// Peephole rules that steer SDCC toward Keil C51's encoding choices.
// SDCC emits the 3-byte "ANL direct,#imm" form against ACC where the
// 2-byte "ANL A,#imm" form is available; same for ORL and XRL.
replace { anl acc,#%1 } by { anl a,#%1 }
replace { orl acc,#%1 } by { orl a,#%1 }
replace { xrl acc,#%1 } by { xrl a,#%1 }
